{"seq":2,"slug":"difficulty-ordering","title":"难度排序原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/curriculum-learning-strategies/foundations/difficulty-ordering","wordCount":1536,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"难度排序原理\">难度排序原理</h1><p>&quot;由易到难&quot;听起来天经地义，但只要追问一句&quot;对谁而言的难&quot;，整个概念就会松动。一道两位数乘法对小学生难、对计算器不难；一个长句对刚起步的模型难、对收敛后的模型不难。难度不是样本的固有属性，而是<strong>样本与当前模型能力之间的关系</strong>。本篇把&quot;难度&quot;这个被随口使用的词钉死，并说明为何&quot;易到难&quot;远不是唯一合理的排序。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>把训练样本集记为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{D}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>，课程的本质是定义一个随训练进度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 单调扩张的<strong>可行子集序列</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">D</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⊆</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⊆</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mo>⊆</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">D</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{D}_0 \\subseteq \\mathcal{D}_1 \\subseteq \\cdots \\subseteq \\mathcal{D}_T = \\mathcal{D}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊆</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊆</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊆</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>，模型在第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 阶段只在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">D</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{D}_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 上训练。&quot;由易到难&quot;意味着先进入序列的是低难度样本。这个形式化把课程拆成两个正交的决策：<strong>用什么函数给样本定难度</strong>（难度度量），以及<strong>子集以多快的节奏扩张</strong>（调度）。本篇聚焦前者的概念基础，后者分别落在<a href=\"../difficulty/difficulty-measures\">难度度量</a>与<a href=\"../difficulty/pacing-functions\">调度函数</a>。</p>\n<p>难度的三种参照系决定了它的全部歧义来源：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[一个训练样本的&#39;难度&#39;] --&gt; B[相对人类先验&lt;br/&gt;句长/步数/词频]&#10;  A --&gt; C[相对模型当前状态&lt;br/&gt;损失/置信度]&#10;  A --&gt; D[相对训练动态&lt;br/&gt;遗忘频率/学习速度]&#10;  B --&gt; E[静态:训练前一次算好]&#10;  C --&gt; F[动态:随模型能力漂移]&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; G[预定义课程]&#10;  F --&gt; H[自适应课程]\">flowchart TD\n  A[一个训练样本的'难度'] --&gt; B[相对人类先验&lt;br/&gt;句长/步数/词频]\n  A --&gt; C[相对模型当前状态&lt;br/&gt;损失/置信度]\n  A --&gt; D[相对训练动态&lt;br/&gt;遗忘频率/学习速度]\n  B --&gt; E[静态:训练前一次算好]\n  C --&gt; F[动态:随模型能力漂移]\n  D --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; G[预定义课程]\n  F --&gt; H[自适应课程]</pre><p>下表对照三种参照系，它们各自支撑不同的课程范式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参照系</th>\n<th>难度由谁定义</th>\n<th>是否随训练变化</th>\n<th>典型度量</th>\n<th>通向的范式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>人类先验</td>\n<td>任务的外在结构</td>\n<td>否（静态）</td>\n<td>句长、推理步数、词频</td>\n<td>预定义课程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型状态</td>\n<td>模型此刻的损失</td>\n<td>是（动态）</td>\n<td>即时损失、置信度间隔</td>\n<td>自步 / 自适应课程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>训练动态</td>\n<td>样本被学会的过程</td>\n<td>是（动态）</td>\n<td>遗忘次数、首次学会的步数</td>\n<td>数据剪枝 / 自动课程</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"静态难度-人类先验的便利与陷阱\">静态难度：人类先验的便利与陷阱</h2><p>最易实现的难度是基于人类可观测的外在结构：自然语言里用句子长度或稀有词比例，数学里用推理步数或操作数大小，图像里用分辨率或遮挡程度。它的好处是<strong>训练前一次算好、零额外开销、可解释</strong>。但它有一个致命假设——人类觉得难的，模型也觉得难。这个假设经常不成立：一个语法复杂但高频的句式，对见过海量语料的模型可能毫不费力；一个简单但分布外的样本，对模型却极难。静态难度因此只是模型真实难度的一个<strong>有噪声代理</strong>，代理误差正是上一篇里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>bias</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_\\text{bias}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">bias</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的主要来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"动态难度-让模型自己说什么难\">动态难度：让模型自己说什么难</h2><p>更贴合&quot;难度是关系&quot;这一洞察的，是用模型当前状态来定义难度：哪条样本现在损失高、置信度低，哪条就是现在的难样本。这种难度随训练实时漂移——开局的难题练几步后可能就移出难样本集。动态难度是自步学习与自动课程的根基，它把&quot;排序&quot;从一次性预处理变成训练循环里的在线决策。代价是计算开销（每步要前向评估候选样本）和潜在的不稳定（难度信号本身带方差）。第三种参照系&quot;训练动态&quot;更进一步，不看某一时刻而看整段历史——一个样本被反复学会又遗忘，说明它处在能力边界上，这类信号驱动了数据剪枝与<a href=\"../adaptive/automatic-curriculum\">自动课程（RL）</a>里的学习潜力评分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为何-易到难-不是唯一答案\">为何&quot;易到难&quot;不是唯一答案</h2><p>课程学习这个名字暗示了单一方向，但研究反复发现<strong>反向课程（由难到易）在特定条件下更优</strong>。2025 年 10 月一篇系统研究 LLM 数学推理数据排序的工作（arXiv:2510.19099）发现：没有任何一种排序普遍占优，forward 与 reverse 谁更好，联合取决于模型能力与任务复杂度——forward CL 训出的模型更&quot;谨慎&quot;、更具不确定性意识，reverse CL 则保留更高的果断与置信度。直觉上，反向课程在早期用困难样本打破参数对称、强迫模型学习区分性特征，避免过早收敛到只对简单样本有效的平凡解；某些对比学习与难负样本挖掘正是这个思路。</p>\n<p>下式给出一个统一视角：把第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 阶段的样本权重写成关于难度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 和阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的门控</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>s</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_t(d) = \\mathbb{1}[\\,s\\cdot d \\le \\lambda_t\\,], \\quad s \\in \\{+1, -1\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s=+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 是 forward（先放低难度），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s=-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 是 reverse（先放高难度），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 放宽。排序方向只是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 的符号选择，它不是公理，而是一个该用验证集去试的超参。</p>\n<h2 id=\"难度排序与混杂因素\">难度排序与混杂因素</h2><p>一个排序课程在工程上几乎从不&quot;只改顺序&quot;：按难度分桶训练往往同时改变了每个桶的数据量、批内难度方差、甚至有效学习率（难样本梯度大）。这意味着报出来的&quot;课程增益&quot;可能来自这些副作用而非顺序本身。把顺序效应从这些混杂里干净剥离，是评测课程时最难的部分，详见<a href=\"../practice/curriculum-evaluation\">评测</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>难度不是样本固有属性，而是样本与当前模型能力的关系；它有人类先验、模型状态、训练动态三种参照系。</li>\n<li>课程 = 定义随训练单调扩张的可行子集序列，可拆为&quot;难度度量 × 调度&quot;两个正交决策。</li>\n<li>静态难度零开销但只是有噪代理；动态难度更贴合本质但有计算与稳定性代价。</li>\n<li>&quot;易到难&quot;只是门控符号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s=+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 的选择；reverse CL 在 LLM 数学推理等场景有时更优，方向应被当作可调超参。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"../difficulty/difficulty-measures\">难度度量</a> 把三种参照系变成可计算公式、<a href=\"curriculum-taxonomy\">课程范式谱系</a> 按静态/动态难度归类方法、<a href=\"../practice/curriculum-evaluation\">评测</a> 处理顺序与数据量的混杂。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../continual-lifelong-learning/foundations/catastrophic-forgetting\">灾难性遗忘</a>（训练动态参照系里&quot;遗忘&quot;信号的反面）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"难度排序原理","id":"难度排序原理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"静态难度：人类先验的便利与陷阱","id":"静态难度-人类先验的便利与陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"动态难度：让模型自己说什么难","id":"动态难度-让模型自己说什么难"},{"level":2,"text":"为何\"易到难\"不是唯一答案","id":"为何-易到难-不是唯一答案"},{"level":2,"text":"难度排序与混杂因素","id":"难度排序与混杂因素"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"为何课程学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/curriculum-learning-strategies/foundations/why-curriculum-learning"},"next":{"title":"课程范式谱系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/curriculum-learning-strategies/foundations/curriculum-taxonomy"}}